# QA Quality Gate

- Use the `qa-engineer` agent for test planning, API coverage, browser automation, regression, and failure triage.
- Read the matching `.cursor/skills/qa-*/SKILL.md` workflow before QA implementation.
- Before claiming application changes are verified, run the narrow affected test and the appropriate `npm run qa:*` gate.
- Use `npm run qa` for the deterministic local gate; reserve `npm run qa:all` for environments with the legacy E2E dependencies configured.
- Default tests to local or sandbox environments. Never mutate production or commit secrets/test accounts.
- Mock AI, email, Stripe, S3, Unsplash, sockets, and other external boundaries in deterministic regression tests.
- Report commands, pass/fail evidence, defects, and remaining risk; do not hide failures with sleeps, retries, or weaker assertions.
